    title: "ruby: the call shapes WI-napaf left silent -- an untyped variable receiver (obj.write), a no-argument implicit-self call (params, current_user, puts), an AMB-METHOD name (load(ext) with 6 project defs), super(...) and direct recursion emit no edge of any type"  # a5a4
    status: todo_hard  # a5a4
    priority: 2  # a5a4
    parent:  # a5a4
